  "reason": "RNA-only PCA singleprofile is the strongest result so far, while image-only ResNet is weak, so the RNA path is promising but we lack evidence on whether multiple profiles add value. config_002 keeps the same PCA RNA encoder and tests the minimal multiprofile extension with simple avgpool aggregation, clarifying the profile/aggregation effect before adding learned encoders or fusion. It is the best next budget use because it is directly comparable to config_001, low complexity, and reduces uncertainty about an important design choice."
